ehicle and transport documents required for the national and international carriage of goods and passengers;</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="778"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="778"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="607"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d9cb55e4-1c21-4c43-ad21-2a6e2a524ed5"><source>4.1.4.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="779">4.1.4.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="779"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="779"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="608"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="36ea0c60-980c-432a-bf56-01611690a20f"><source>How to behave in the event of an accident; knowledge of measures to be taken after an accident or similar occur- rence, including emergency action such as evacuation of passengers and basic knowledge of first aid;</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="780">How to behave in the event of an accident; knowledge of measures to be taken after an accident or similar occur- rence, including emergency action such as evacuation of passengers and basic knowledge of first aid;</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="780"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="780"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="609"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f034d390-df23-49d3-adca-926d54e796e1"><source>4.1.5.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="781">4.1.5.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="781"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="781"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="610"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d5a078fd-2e1a-4962-ab5a-0ae7672f28fa"><source>The precautions to be taken during the removal and replacement of wheels;</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="782">The precautions to be taken during the removal and replacement of wheels;</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="782"/></target><sdl