nit id="2150208f-2bb6-48f5-98d5-8b124ac72e50"><source>Reading a road map, route planning, including the use of electronic navigation systems (optional);</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="788">Reading a road map, route planning, including the use of electronic navigation systems (optional);</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="788"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="788"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="617"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c95196d0-e909-45bd-be7e-785cb56bf909"><source>4.1.9.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="789">4.1.9.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="789"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="789"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="618"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="59f441b2-17f2-4c34-9649-d7f97c81ed6c"><source>Safety factors relating to vehicle loading: controlling the load (stowing and fastening), difficulties with different kinds of load (e.g. liquids, hanging loads, …), loading and unloading goods and the use of loading equipment (categories C, CE, C1, C1E only);</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="790">Safety factors relating to vehicle loading:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="791">controlling the load (stowing and fastening), difficulties with different kinds of load (e.g. liquids, hanging loads, …), loading and unloading goods and the use of loading equipment (categories C, CE, C1, C1E only);</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="790"/> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="791"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="790"/><sdl:seg id="791"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="619"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="bdc03990-c2e0-456d-b969-dd6609cc4d5b"><source>4.1.10. The driver&apos;s responsibility in respect to the carriage of passengers; comfort and safety of passengers; transport of children; necessary checks before driving away; all sorts of buses should be part of the theory test (public service buses and coaches, buses with special dimensions, …) (categories D, DE, D1, D1E only).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="792">4.1.10.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="793">The driver&apos;s responsibility in respect to the carriage of passengers; comfort and safety of passengers; transport of children; necessary checks before driving away; all sorts of buses should be part of the theory test (public service buses and coaches, buses with special dimensions, …) (categories D, DE, D1, D1E only).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="792"/> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="793"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="792"/><sdl:seg id="793"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="620"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="aecbe14d-34ff-4518-97e6-088d6f4fa5d5"><source>4.2.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="794">4.2.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="794">4.2.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="794" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="obrazec_TM" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-FHSDSOR\Marija Pavlova</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">07/10/2026 12:13:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">07/10/2026 12:13:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-FHSDSOR\Marija Pavlova</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1057708863</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="621"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="38e9e332-88fe-4fb9-9f25-f92db3bf6dd1"><source>Compulsory check of general knowledge on the following additional provisions concerning categories C, CE, D and DE:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="795">Compulsory check of general knowledge on the following additional provisions concerning categories C, CE, D and DE:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="795"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="795"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxt