 parts, connection, use and day-to-day maintenance of coupling systems (categories CE, DE only);</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="817"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="817"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="638"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c6047ba0-e364-4d8d-9498-a4022e1b2d6f"><source>4.2.6.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="818">4.2.6.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="818"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="818"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="639"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fde044c3-554c-4ef8-9bdf-e1f6c8659147"><source>Methods of locating causes of breakdowns;</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="819">Methods of locating causes of breakdowns;</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="819"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="819"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="640"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5ec3fe0e-ded2-4714-a582-f49c3ef2b254"><source>4.2.7.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="820">4.2.7.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="820"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="820"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="641"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="21b773c9-e7c8-4bd2-9c3e-deeccec2a6bc"><source>Preventive maintenance of vehicles and necessary running repairs;</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="821">Preventive maintenance of vehicles and necessary running repairs;</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="821"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="821"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="642"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="180d2867-611c-4297-954a-d7ccf9db63c9"><source>4.2.8.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="822">4.2.8.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="822"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="822"/></sdl:seg-defs></trans-u